WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:05.300
Thank you, everyone! I love you all!

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:10.530
I want to see you all participate in the final Grand Prix!

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.990
Every idol has her own unique brilliance!

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:20.330
I can see your brilliance with my heart's gaze!

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.250
You can <i>all</i> become Divine Idols!

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:23.820
The time is Vermeer! Let's get g-Rubens!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.230
You bet your cosmos I'm entering!

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.210
Kyupikon!
The time is Vermeer! Let's get g-Rubens!

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.960
Fired up and ready-chanko!

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:30.170
Ready-sadako!

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.210
Ready-ami!

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.430
Hip, hip, hoor-Eiko!

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.420
Much obliged.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.220
Service ace!

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.100
Oh!

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.600
But of course!

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:43.660
You can <i>all</i> become Divine Idols!

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.500
<i>Listen well to what I say.</i>

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:32.960
<i>You will attain victory at the next Grand Prix without fail.</i>

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:36.800
<i>This is the only way to take the baton from Onee-sama.</i>

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.420
<i>B–But...</i>

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.010
<i>I couldn't possibly steal a goddess's baton...</i>

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:46.220
<i>It is all for the sake of protecting the order of PriPara.</i>

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.570
<i>You understand.</i>

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:52.210
<i>Yes...</i>

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:56.860
<i>What Janice says is correct.</i>

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.840
<i>I have been acknowledged by her, the sister to a goddess.</i>

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.860
<i>Jewlie is not suitable to be a goddess.</i>

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.860
<i>She does not deserve to wield the baton.</i>

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.780
<i>And yet...</i>

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:11.920
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.880
We have an announcement for you all.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:19.890
The long-awaited fourth Divine Idol Grand Prix,
the Divine Tops competition,

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:24.690
will be held on the 25th of December: Christmas Day!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.180
All right!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:32.130
And this round shall see the Divine Tops freed!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.500
I love Christmas!

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:47.200
Me too! If we win the Divine Idol Grand Prix, it'll be the most wonderful Christmas ever!

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.660
I want to enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:56.130
But in order to enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.590
an idol needs a Super Cyalume Coord.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.300
It's time for us to really prove our mettle,

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.770
and strut our stuff on stage!

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.560
Hey, Falulu!

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.940
Hello, everyone!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:21.280
I wanted to let you know Tricolore's not entering this Grand Prix.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.490
What? But why?

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:28.990
Maho-chan has to attend a number of Christmas dinner shows.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:36.460
And it seems one of Fuwari's goat companion's
cow friend is giving birth soon, so she's helping out.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.410
I see... that's too bad.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:40.630
Capisce!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.340
But you'll cheer us on, right, Falulu?

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:44.800
Of course.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.600
Once they're finished with their business,
we'll come right over.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:50.160
Come on, are you serious-kuma?
There must be something you can do-usa!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.560
Kuma-san, Usagi-san, what's the matter?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.560
What <i>isn't</i> the matter?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.520
Every training room's full-usa!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.980
What?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.100
Indeed. After Jewlie's announcement the other day,

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.450
training rooms and stages have been fully booked!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:09.210
From that thing Jewlie said? Amazing...

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.820
Hey there, Jululu.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:19.300
And that amazing goddess is just this innocent baby.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.380
It's pri-ncredible.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.730
Wow, they're all really going for it!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:34.270
And the ones who couldn't
book a studio are practicing outside.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.550
Lala-chan!

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:40.420
We formed a team.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:43.730
We're going to leap out from
the court and slam it down on stage!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.400
We're Love Smash!
Love Smash

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:51.370
Your first-ever fan is going to aim for Divine Idolhood just like you!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:54.870
I just had to tell you first!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.500
Go for it, Eiko-chan!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.900
You too, Love-chan, Nodoka-chan!

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.250
You look like a powerful team!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.340
And pri strong rivals.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:09.460
If you're talking about strong rivals, look no further.

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.220
Reeling in shock – you've formed a team, too, Iroha?

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.480
We three may go unnoticed at times,

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.190
but we'll gather our courage and go for it!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:23.900
Wow, you too?

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.440
I'll have you concede defeat.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.070
Then we shall grow as our swords clash!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.110
Much obliged.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:30.950
Wah!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:32.620
It's Tokuda Nene-pri!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:37.100
Much time has passed since I denounced PriPara idols.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.870
And I'm making my team debut at last!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:40.340
Sub Me Tender

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.290
We're Sub Me Tender!

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.600
We may be only sub-characters,

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:48.760
but we want you to love us too. That's our name idea.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.970
What a lovely team name.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.680
Lady Sophie!

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:55.930
...chanko!

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:59.460
Unworthy though we may be, we Sophie's Royal Guards

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:03.150
have formed a team to enter
the Divine Idol Grand Prix-chanko!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.400
Sophie Alliance Team A

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.320
Sadako-san! And Chanko-chan and Ami-chan, too?

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:10.450
There would be no greater honour

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.780
than attaining a Super Cyalume Coord and
competing in the ring with you, Lady Sophie-chanko!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.240
Mm-hm!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:17.750
Sophie Alliance Team B

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.290
How powerful...

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:24.250
When you're on stage, I'll be <i>your</i> Royal Guard!

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.060
Everyone's totally revved up!

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.930
I've gotta cheer for everyone!

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:34.920
Though we know the winners are right here.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:39.700
But if the more teams enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.190
the more fun it'll be!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.140
I guess you're right.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.810
That's Reona for you-pri.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.870
You can say that again.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:55.490
Now, we'll get down to some cosmic practice too!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.410
It's cosmastic that we managed to find a member

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.500
who's a perfect fit for our individuality!

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.210
And with that said...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:09.670
Indeed, the time has come at last.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.560
We'll show you our power as well.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.490
You said it!

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:17.220
Cheers!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:18.960
It's time for us to step back...

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.680
into the spotlight as idols again!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:21.770
Fight, whee!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.890
Madame Cleaner

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:31.370
As you can see, PriPara is experiencing
an unprecedented boom in new teams!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:35.810
I'm sure we'll see many teams attain Super Cyalume Coords as well!

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:37.830
Oh, I'm not sure I can bear it much longer!

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.850
U–Um...

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.560
If you need to go potty, there's one there...

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.920
I'm not talking about going wee-wee!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.210
I can't bear <i>Onee-sama</i>!

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.440
For a goddess, the Divine Idol
Grand Prix is a sacred ceremony.

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:55.430
Super Cyalume Coords are not to be
doled out willy-nilly to third-rate idols.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:59.760
A Divine Idol should be an
excellent specimen and lead by example.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:03.020
Indeed, Chiri, you are the picture of such an idol.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:06.350
You should be the closest to Divine Idolhood.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.560
Onee-sama's methods are incorrect.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:12.650
I must become the goddess myself and correct this situation.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.070
You have the aptitude.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.860
And you shall claim victory.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:18.410
You understand?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.490
Yes...

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.350
Oh, what should I do?

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:36.050
One, two, three, four!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.250
They're all pri-nthusiastic!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.160
They're really going for it!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.150
Isn't that great, Jululu?

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.980
Ohoho!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:48.920
It's Celebrity 4...

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.440
Hello there.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.680
Hi!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.770
Not <i>just</i> Celebrity 4...

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:58.660
We, Super Celebrity 3, are entering too!

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:03.410
We stand on the world stage,
and we're here to light a fire in your hearts!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:07.980
Kuma?
What?

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:09.330
Ucha?
Huh?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:10.640
Neko?
Hm?

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.100
Here's Ajimi,

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.350
Cosmo,

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.440
and our long awaited third member!
and our long await-anabe Rusayama third member!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.150
and our long await-anabe Rusayama third member!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:35.530
Kyu...

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.150
Kyupikon!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:38.990
I'm Nanami!

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.540
Q.P.Cosmix's show

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.920
Kyupikon!
cosmically starts now!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.130
Da Vinci!
Kyupikon!

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:04.740
This night is gonna be cosmically spacey!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.810
It's a surprise, kyupikon!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.930
Ga-Gi-Gu-Ge-Giger!

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.390
Amazing...

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.900
They're certainly something.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.360
Onee-sama, you're cosmically cool!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.820
Thank you very Munch!
Cosmic!
Kyupi-kyupikon!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:22.870
Here we go!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:26.000
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.930
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.210
Thanks a cosmos!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:33.210
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:36.740
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.130
Da Vinci!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.590
Kyu-pi...

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.550
Cosmic!

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:46.260
Vinci, Da Vinci, woo!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.890
The closet's doors open for you...

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.750
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.440
Thank you very Munch!
Cosmic!
Kyupi-kyupikon!

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:58.700
All right!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.570
To protect Lady Sophie!

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:07.910
I have cultivated this voluptuous body!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:11.370
Making Drama, switch on!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.750
Killer move: moonsault dosukoi press!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.130
Go for it!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.550
Hooray, hooray!

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.770
Here we go again!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.770
Divine Idol Challenge!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.110
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.280
Victory!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.650
Chanko!

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:50.760
They're amazing-pri!

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.410
How wonderful!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.800
How hip-neko! I love it-neko!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.760
Now, this feeling takes me back!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:12.730
That it does! Though I'm shorter on breath than I was back then...

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.190
Ran-ny!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:23.620
Mum and the principal are so cool!

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:27.500
Yeah, but I bet they'll feel it tomorrow morning...

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:27.570
Here we go again and again!
Yeah, but I bet they'll feel it tomorrow morning...

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.530
Here we go again and again!

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:31.990
... to become a Divine Idol!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.170
We did it!
We did it-glo!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.770
Garu!

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.050
The principal's so amazing!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.130
How bewitching... Veterans are fearsome!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.480
Love Smash!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.690
Carry it to you!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.150
Service Ace!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.620
That was wonderful, Love-chan!

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.610
Hit it more, Eiko-chan!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.060
Smash it into me too!

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:09.990
Come on, smash!

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:11.820
You're out!

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:14.950
Hitting smashes into the fans is not allowed!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.370
How frustrating, love-fifteen!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.220
Forehand...

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.290
Double fault!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:26.220
Centre point!

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:30.140
Much obliged...

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.600
What a bummer...

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.040
There are three members to a team!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.870
Hiding an extra member in your coat won't work!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.830
They're useless!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:07.220
Yay!

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.120
Come on!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.970
Here we go!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.890
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.850
Yay!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.050
Thank you!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:17.500
Bravo!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.270
We did it!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:27.480
Photosynthesis!

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:31.240
Entrancing! Like Lucifer's incarnation before us!

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.200
Garmageddon's most wicked and powerful rival appears!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.420
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.050
Photosynthetic!

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.940
Take in my carbon dioxide!

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:44.850
Massive! So massive!

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:47.550
Hi, all!

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.220
Onee-sama!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:51.010
I'm so cosmically happy!

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:55.430
Look, Millet-dies! A Super Cyalume Coord-Da Vinci!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.430
Congratulations-kuma!
Congratulations-usa!
Congratulations!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.890
Congratulations, Onee-sama!

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.310
Lady Sophie!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.980
It was all thanks to your encouragement, Lady Sophie!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.770
Sophie Alliance Team A

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:11.970
received Super Cyalume Coords, see-chanko?

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:15.410
And Team B's in training so they can avenge themselves next time!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.260
I see.

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:20.240
Congratulations, Team A!

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:23.120
Your performance was very powerful!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:26.330
PriPara's become a hotbed of excitement!

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:30.940
I'm sure we'll see the greatest turnout yet in the next Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:35.090
It may turn out to be the largest Grand Prix in history!

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.510
And there's no way we're losing-pri!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.330
Mm, after watching everyone else perform, I can't sit still!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.480
I think it's time for SoLaMi SMILE to show our own power again!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.510
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.250
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.960
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:10.210
They're not going to let the new team boom overshadow them:

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.700
it's SoLaMi SMILE's ever-popular team coord!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.090
SoLaMi SMILE Coord!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:16.230
Pri!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:33.670
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.720
Here...

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:40.760
we go!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.020
Carry it

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:46.980
to everyone!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.890
Receive our feelings!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:53.900
Exciting present for you!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.690
Super Cyalume Change!

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.370
Pri!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.730
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:55.390
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:59.940
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:03.850
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:26.220
The closet's doors open for you...

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:29.190
Within is an item fit for a Divine Idol!

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.380
We did it!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.300
Matching Starry Coords – all right!

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.850
Mum, Principal, Rina-chan, congratulations!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.650
Thank whoo!

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:54.020
Thank you-glo!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.900
Don't sound so surprised!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.740
That's my daughter for you.

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:01.070
That was the best performance yet!

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:06.240
But don't go forgetting, Lala.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.850
Your mum's also your rival, you know?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:11.540
Non?

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:15.970
Excuse me, Mum! Lala's rival is right here!

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:17.250
Of course, of course...

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:21.340
And besides, aren't you forgetting NonSugar?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:26.220
It's not all about Onee-chan –
I'm your strongest rival, okay?

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.040
You're right there.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.560
Next week at the Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.310
We'll be cheering you on with all our strength,

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:37.900
but we'll also be competing on stage,
no holds barred-chanko!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:40.730
Okay! I look forward to it!

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:43.100
And we'll be giving it our best as well!

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:44.870
We're gonna beat you all down!

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.030
Well, I'm sure <i>not</i> losing!

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:51.200
It's kind of weird, being rivals with Mum!

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:56.650
We knocked it out of the cosmos!
Kyupikon! Kyupikon, kyupikon, kyupikon!

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:03.090
Jululu.

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:07.050
Isn't it great how everyone's entering now?

00:22:12.340 --> 00:22:13.650
Goodnight.

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:54.500
Christmas is also the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:57.490
It's NonSugar's last chance for victory!

00:23:57.490 --> 00:24:00.540
Gonna win, eat lots of yummy food!

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:01.860
Hm? Where's Chiri?

00:24:01.860 --> 00:24:03.320
Haven't seen today.

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:04.210
What?

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:08.600
I can't go to PriPara...

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:11.040
I'll go and bring Chiri back!

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:13.220
The three of us have gotta win together!

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:14.740
Me go to!

00:24:14.740 --> 00:24:16.780
Next time, <i>Merry Grand Prix!</i>

00:24:16.780 --> 00:24:19.890
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
